#var, use "command >Rest Client: Switch Environment" in search bar of vs code 
@id=1
@facultyId=1
###

### Get all schools
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/schools?page=1&limit=10 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Get school by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/schools/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a new school
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/schools HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "FILO",
  "description": "Escuela de Filosofía y Ciencias Sociales",
  "facultyId": "{{facultyId}}",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Update a school
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/schools/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "INF",
  "description": "Escuela de Informática actualizada",
  "facultyId": "{{facultyId}}",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Delete a school
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/schools/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

